ency. This remains only a hypothesis for follow-up because it was motivated by the discovery evidence.\n\nAt this stage, no predictor-outcome pair is accepted as scientifically meaningful in this dataset. The most useful next analysis is to run the already registered broad screen H14-H24 plus the H3 reversal H25. This will cover the remaining outcomes using the balanced binary predictors already selected and test whether feature_002 has a more consistent association with outcome_006. Claims remain associations within the supplied dataset only; none support causality or generalizability.",
